    "turn_idx": 74,
    "turn_text": "Again, I have nothing but admiration for the way that they have pushed the boundaries of our sport. However, there's always been this underlying factor. There's a reason that those athletes are not competing under their own flag. They're representing the ROC, the Russian Olympic Committee. And I think that we're kind of at a point now where all of us figure skaters are like, we need a change in the system because we need to ensure all sports are on clean ground because this is not the first time that this has happened, but it is the first time that we're allowing a skater, an athlete with kind of read alert to compete. So the fact that this is happening is mind-blowing all of us. I mean, Shakei Richardson said, what is the difference between my case and Camilla's? And it's because she's a protected person because she's a minor. However, the fact that the metal ceremony is delayed indefinitely really puts a damper on the Olympics.",
